  "description": "In 1993, at the first ultimate fighting championsip, a skinny unknown brazilian fighter takes the win without any severe injuries.    \nPeople start to show interest in this individual's fighting technique that led to worldwide recognition of the brazilian martial art known as \"Jiu Jitsu\".  \nUnchan is a whimpy teenager who has trouble with bullies at school.  \nAlthough he wishes to fight back, he is not able to hit other people because of his traumatic childhood.  \nHe starts to gain a fighting chance as he gets into the non-striking brazlian martial art form.  \nNow, let's see Unchan kick some ass!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=4709013), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/52622084), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3498010869), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/comic/ep_list/tjqmaltus), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/submission)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/148564)",
